CloudBSD parallel packaging of DRM 6.6 core kernel modules (drm, ttm,
dmabuf) from freebsd/drm-kmod.

This port does not ship vendor GPU drivers. Install
cloudbsd-drm-66-amdgpu-kmod, cloudbsd-drm-66-i915-kmod,
cloudbsd-drm-66-radeon-kmod, and/or cloudbsd-nvidia-drm-66-kmod as needed,
or the metaport cloudbsd-drm-66-kmod for the full set.

Conflicts with stock graphics/drm-*-kmod packages (same module basenames).
Choose either the stock monorepo package or the CloudBSD split stack.
